        <p class="note-lead">People learn, build, recommend and solve problems around your product.</p>
        <p>In places your company runs and places it does not.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="note" data-note="1" id="nar-note-2">
        <span class="note-kicker">System view 02 · Many groups at once</span>
