        <span class="note-kicker">System view 05 · Learning in both directions</span>
        <p class="note-lead">A developer&rsquo;s workaround can inform documentation; a product question can bring the right practitioners into a research session.</p>
        <p class="note-verbs"><span>Identify.</span> <span class="on">Understand.</span> <span class="on">Shape.</span> <span>Strengthen.</span></p>
